    "turn_text": "Yeah, the question is, will they ever give you the evidence? So Michael, from St. Peter's, are you aware of any measures that can be put in place to ensure that a government bureaucrat, such as Dr. Fauci, doesn't acquire power again during a crisis to institute disastrous public policy?",
